This package is a DeepSeek Harness plugin wrapper around the "promo-video-maker"
project by 程序员鱼皮 (liyupi):

    https://github.com/liyupi/ai-promo-video-maker
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 程序员鱼皮 (liyupi)

Files copied from upstream, unmodified:

    AGENTS.md, SKILL.md, CLAUDE.md, .env.example, LICENSE
    references/               (all 8 handbooks)
    template/                 (Remotion project, web player, Python scripts)
    docs/images/case-*.jpg, docs/images/styles-*.jpg

Modifications made by this repository:

    - Added the DSH plugin layer that upstream does not have:
      package.json (name, exports, dsh.bundle.patch, engines), cordis.patch.yml,
      lib/index.js (composes the skill body and registers it via ctx.skills),
      lib/types/index.d.ts, test/plugin.test.mjs, and the README pair.
    - Wrote the plugin-specific preamble prepended to AGENTS.md: it resolves
      <工具目录>/<输出目录> to absolute paths and documents how plugin usage
      differs from the clone-style usage.
    - Removed upstream's outputs/ directory (it only held a .gitkeep) and its
      README (replaced by this plugin's README.md / README.zh.md).
    - Removed docs/images/showcase.gif (5.4 MB) to keep the plugin tarball small;
      the READMEs use static stills instead.

The upstream MIT license text is retained verbatim in LICENSE.
The upstream project is the work that makes any of this useful; this repository
only changes how it is installed and discovered.
